WEBVTT

aai-1
00:00:10.131 --> 00:00:12.716 needsReview
Hi, everybody. This week, I delivered my

aai-2
00:00:13.216 --> 00:00:15.558 needsReview
State of the Union address. Today, here's

aai-3
00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:18.754 needsReview
the 3-minute version. After 4 years of

aai-4
00:00:18.802 --> 00:00:21.002 needsReview
economic growth with 8 million new private

aai-5
00:00:21.502 --> 00:00:23.298 needsReview
sector jobs, our unemployment rate is the

aai-6
00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:25.048 needsReview
lowest it's been in more than 5 years.

aai-7
00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:27.265 needsReview
And with the economy speeding up,

aai-8
00:00:28.116 --> 00:00:30.093 needsReview
companies say they intend to hire more

aai-9
00:00:30.221 --> 00:00:32.873 needsReview
people this year. But while those at the

aai-10
00:00:33.373 --> 00:00:34.849 needsReview
top are doing better than ever, average

aai-11
00:00:34.945 --> 00:00:38.143 needsReview
wages have barely budged. Inequality has

aai-12
00:00:38.239 --> 00:00:40.601 needsReview
deepened. Too many Americans are working

aai-13
00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.317 needsReview
harder and harder just to get by, and too

aai-14
00:00:43.817 --> 00:00:46.948 needsReview
many still aren't working at all. Our job

aai-15
00:00:47.448 --> 00:00:49.519 needsReview
is to reverse those trends. It's time to

aai-16
00:00:50.019 --> 00:00:52.314 needsReview
restore opportunity for all people. The

aai-17
00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:55.060 needsReview
idea that no matter who you are, if you

aai-18
00:00:55.124 --> 00:00:56.216 needsReview
work hard and live up to your

aai-19
00:00:56.248 --> 00:00:58.721 needsReview
responsibilities, you can make it if you

aai-20
00:00:59.221 --> 00:01:01.627 needsReview
try. The opportunity agenda I laid out on

aai-21
00:01:02.127 --> 00:01:04.341 needsReview
Tuesday has 4 parts. This week, I took

aai-22
00:01:04.357 --> 00:01:07.070 needsReview
them on the road. Job one is more new

aai-23
00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.094 needsReview
jobs— jobs in construction and

aai-24
00:01:09.158 --> 00:01:11.663 needsReview
manufacturing; jobs in innovation and

aai-25
00:01:11.727 --> 00:01:14.264 needsReview
energy. In Wisconsin, I talked with plant

aai-26
00:01:14.376 --> 00:01:17.556 needsReview
workers at GE about part 2. Training more

aai-27
00:01:17.604 --> 00:01:19.820 needsReview
Americans with the skills to fill those

aai-28
00:01:19.917 --> 00:01:22.856 needsReview
new jobs. In Tennessee, I talked with

aai-29
00:01:22.888 --> 00:01:25.683 needsReview
students about part 3— guaranteeing every

aai-30
00:01:25.779 --> 00:01:28.172 needsReview
child access to a world-class education

aai-31
00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.437 needsReview
from early childhood through college and

aai-32
00:01:30.937 --> 00:01:33.151 needsReview
right into a career. And with steelworkers

aai-33
00:01:33.183 --> 00:01:35.111 needsReview
in Pittsburgh and retail workers in

aai-34
00:01:35.611 --> 00:01:38.436 needsReview
Maryland, I laid out part 4— making sure

aai-35
00:01:38.548 --> 00:01:41.022 needsReview
hard work pays off for men and women,

aai-36
00:01:41.696 --> 00:01:43.927 needsReview
with wages you can live on, savings you

aai-37
00:01:44.427 --> 00:01:46.652 needsReview
can retire on, and health insurance that's

aai-38
00:01:47.152 --> 00:01:48.961 needsReview
there for you when you need it. These

aai-39
00:01:49.057 --> 00:01:50.997 needsReview
ideas will strengthen the middle class and

aai-40
00:01:51.497 --> 00:01:52.905 needsReview
help more people work their way into the

aai-41
00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.726 needsReview
middle class. Some of them will require

aai-42
00:01:56.226 --> 00:01:58.836 needsReview
Congress. But wherever I can take steps to

aai-43
00:01:59.336 --> 00:02:01.305 needsReview
expand opportunity for more families on my

aai-44
00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:04.143 needsReview
own, I will. I'm going to ask business

aai-45
00:02:04.643 --> 00:02:05.649 needsReview
leaders, education leaders, and

aai-46
00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:07.493 needsReview
philanthropic leaders to partner with us

aai-47
00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:09.979 needsReview
to advance these goals. And every single

aai-48
00:02:10.479 --> 00:02:11.891 needsReview
day, I'm going to fight for these

aai-49
00:02:11.923 --> 00:02:14.220 needsReview
priorities— to shift the odds back in

aai-50
00:02:14.236 --> 00:02:16.019 needsReview
favor of more working and middle-class

aai-51
00:02:16.519 --> 00:02:18.782 needsReview
families, and to keep America a place

aai-52
00:02:19.215 --> 00:02:20.998 needsReview
where you can always make it if you try.

aai-53
00:02:22.042 --> 00:02:24.371 needsReview
Thanks. Have a great weekend, and enjoy

aai-54
00:02:24.871 --> 00:02:24.998 needsReview
the Super Bowl.
